    "description": "The target takes the form of a deer. Its Strength and Constitution cannot be lower than +1 and +4; its land movement is doubled. It can communicate with deer, see in darkness, carry one rider, and feed on grass. It attacks with its antlers (1d10, Open Roll 9–10). Higher Strength and Constitution traits are retained; its equipment takes on the animal form’s appearance and returns to normal when the target changes back.",
